The rollout parser, trace reconstruction, utilities, fixtures and baseline tests
originate from the upstream project. This distribution adds YAML configuration,
privacy filtering, global/project hook installation, acknowledged export handling,
HTTP integration tests and documentation. It is independently maintained and is
not an official OpenAI or Langfuse product.

The bundled dist/index.mjs includes MIT/Apache-2.0/ISC dependencies (Langfuse,
OpenTelemetry, YAML and Zod) with license texts in plugins/tracing/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.
